Keep a shared source as empty text.
Place "aaabb" into source.
Keep a shared needed as 0.
Set needed to 3.
Keep a shared wanted as empty text.
Keep a shared count as 0.
Keep a shared okay as 0.

To tally from other (a whole number) with finish (a whole number).
If other is more than finish, return.
The piece is the slice of source from other to other plus 1.
If piece is wanted, add 1 to count.
Tally from other plus 1 with finish.

To check from start (a whole number) with finish (a whole number).
Set okay to 1.
For every spot from start to finish.
Set wanted to the slice of source from spot to spot plus 1.
Set count to 0.
Tally from start with finish.
If count is less than needed, set okay to 0.

The last is 4.
The best is 0.
For every start from 0 to last.
For every finish from start to last.
Check from start with finish.
The width is finish minus start plus 1.
If okay is 1 and width is more than best, set best to width.

